  "explanation": "The question asks when the 'Allyn House' was built. Document D1S2 directly states that the Allyn House in Arlington, Massachusetts, was 'Built about 1898.' This is the only source that unambiguously refers to the construction date of the Allyn House in the context of the question. The other references to '1829' pertain either to the Deshon-Allyn House in New London, Connecticut (Document D2S1), or to a different house mentioned in Document D3S4, which is not clearly identified as the same 'Allyn House' in question. Therefore, 'about 1898' is the only valid and directly supported answer."
